ComfyUI-UniDepth
================

This repository bundles a slimmed-down copy of the upstream UniDepth source
tree (under `nodes/unidepth/`) and downloads pretrained model weights from
HuggingFace at runtime.

Upstream project:
    UniDepth: Universal Monocular Metric Depth Estimation
    UniDepthV2: Universal Monocular Metric Depth Estimation Made Simpler
    Luigi Piccinelli, Yung-Hsu Yang, Christos Sakaridis, Mattia Segu,
    Siyuan Li, Wim Abbeloos, Luc Van Gool, Fisher Yu (ETH Zurich)
    https://github.com/lpiccinelli-eth/UniDepth
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.18913  (CVPR 2024)
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.20110  (V2, 2025)

